[list]
[*]The outfit stand's [b]Allow removing items[/b] toggle now describes its effect with Shift Change installed. It does not affect shift changes: stands are stocked, and uniforms taken, with it off. While it is on, the stand's contents are visible to every colonist's apparel optimizer, which may take a uniform and wear it as ordinary clothing; assigning an owner does not prevent this. Off is the default and the correct setting, and colonists removing clothes from an assigned stand is this toggle rather than a fault.
[/list]
